{
  "agent": {
    "name": "皮皮虾",
    "yuan": "ppx",
    "max_tool_rounds": 24,
    "tool_result_budget": 4000,
    "max_tool_error_retry": 2,
    "workspace_prompt_mode": "absolute",
    "proactive": {
      "enabled": true,
      "interval_ms": 3600000
    },
    "evolve": {
      "enabled": true,
      "every_calls": 20,
      "min_interval_ms": 30000
    },
    "self_iteration": {
      "mode": "propose",
      "max_files": 3,
      "max_attempts": 2,
      "max_llm_calls": 6,
      "test_timeout_ms": 60000,
      "allow_test_edit": false
    },
    "self_code": {
      "mode": "propose",
      "syntax_timeout_ms": 5000,
      "test_timeout_ms": 120000
    },
    "metacognition_gate": {
      "_note": "元认知门控 (2026-11-15): 执行前一次轻量 LLM 调用给任务打 {confidence, rationale, suggested_action}。enabled=只观测 (默认关闭, 关闭时零 LLM 调用零写入); reroute_enabled=规则三, 低置信且模型建议 clarify 时**不执行**, 改为向来源方提问 (工单判 MANUAL_REVIEW, 不计完成)。threshold=置信阈值, 低于即低置信。",
      "enabled": false,
      "reroute_enabled": false,
      "threshold": 0.5
    },
    "evolution_loop": {
      "_note": "持续进化循环默认关闭 (Daily self-evolution loop is OFF by default)。设 enabled:true 后每天 03:30 自动跑「弱点学习→代码迭代→度量落账」; 手动单轮: npm run evolve:loop",
      "enabled": false,
      "cron": "03:30",
      "weakness_threshold": 3,
      "min_interval_ms": 60000,
      "effect_feedback": {
        "_note": "效果反哺 (2026-11-16): 把「测出来没用」变成实际动作 —— 给关联策略记有害票, 达到 prune_at 由 growAndRefine 淘汰。默认关闭; 只有 effect 对照已产出 mature cohort 时才有输入。degrade_threshold=判退化的成功率跌幅(0.15=跌15个点), relate_threshold=技能名与策略条目最低词法相似度, max_actions=单轮最多动几条, prune_at=有害票净额达此值才淘汰。",
        "enabled": false,
        "degrade_threshold": 0.15,
        "relate_threshold": 0.25,
        "max_actions": 3,
        "prune_at": 3
      }
    },
    "watchdog": {
      "_note": "外部看门狗: 独立会话巡检进程体征与工单/Worker 进展; 只报告不自动重跑。drift_repeat=连续同工具多少次算漂移, drift_rounds=多少轮无工具步算空转。",
      "enabled": false,
      "interval_minutes": 30,
      "stall_minutes": 15,
      "drift_repeat": 6,
      "drift_rounds": 18
    },
    "router_role": {
      "_note": "Router = 只分派不执行 (工具面只留委派/检索/提问), 干活走 spawn_agent 委派给热池 worker。v5.0 新装默认开启 = 最强 agent 形态; 主会话需要直接写文件/跑命令时改回 false。开启需重启进程, 子进程恒为 worker。",
      "enabled": true,
      "allow": []
    },
    "legion": {
      "_note": "Worker 热池 (v5.0): 预热 N 个常驻委派 worker, spawn_agent 接管热进程免冷启动; 空闲 15 分钟自动回收。0 = 关闭 (每次委派冷启动)。",
      "pool_size": 2
    },
    "delegate_memory_inject": false,
    "approval_mode": "on-request",
    "sandbox": "workspace-write",
    "workspace_allow": [],
    "auto_approve_high_risk": false
  },
  "user": {
    "name": "用户"
  },
  "providers": [
    {
      "id": "openai",
      "base_url": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
      "api_key_env": "OPENAI_API_KEY",
      "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "context_window": 128000
    },
    {
      "id": "deepseek",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
      "protocol": "openai-completions",
      "display_name": "DeepSeek 深度求索",
      "api_key_env": "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY",
      "model": "deepseek-chat",
      "models": [
        { "id": "deepseek-chat", "label": "DeepSeek Chat", "context_window": 131072, "max_output": 8192, "inputs": ["text"] },
        { "id": "deepseek-reasoner", "label": "DeepSeek Reasoner (R1)", "context_window": 131072, "max_output": 65536, "inputs": ["text"] }
      ],
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "context_window": 131072
    },
    {
      "id": "dashscope",
      "base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1",
      "api_key_env": "DASHSCOPE_API_KEY",
      "model": "qwen-turbo",
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "context_window": 131072
    },
    {
      "id": "qwen-vl",
      "base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1",
      "api_key_env": "DASHSCOPE_API_KEY",
      "model": "qwen-vl-max",
      "vision": true,
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "context_window": 32768
    },
    {
      "id": "lmstudio",
      "base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1",
      "api_key": "lm-studio",
      "_note": "本地模型段: 先启动 LM Studio / Ollama, 再把 model 改成本地实际模型名 (Local model: start LM Studio/Ollama first, then set model to your actual local model name; no real key needed)",
      "model": "YOUR_LOCAL_MODEL_NAME",
      "vision": false,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "id": "zhipu",
      "base_url": "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4",
      "api_key_env": "ZHIPU_API_KEY",
      "model": "glm-4v-flash",
      "vision": true,
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "context_window": 65536
    }
  ],
  "memory": {
    "enabled": true,
    "token_budget": 2500,
    "decay_per_day": 0.02,
    "hit_bonus": 5,
    "base_importance": 10,
    "compile_threshold": 4.5,
    "forget_speed": 1,
    "memory_ttl_days": 90
  },
  "budget": {
    "usd": 0,
    "model_prices": {},
    "assume_price": null,
    "_note": "成本按 src/llm/pricing.js 内置目录价快照折算, 是估算值不是账单。usd=0 不限; 达到上限后 chat 拒绝继续调用。model_prices 覆盖内置表 (键=模型前缀, 值={prompt, completion, cached?, currency?, peak?, tiers?}; 人民币写 currency:'CNY', 支持峰谷 peak / 输入长度阶梯 tiers / 缓存价 cached)。assume_price 是未定价模型的兜底单价 (USD/1M, 形如 {prompt:1, completion:3}) —— 不配则按 $0 记账, 但会在「使用统计」标为未定价并告警一次。全表核对: node scripts/pricing-audit.js"
  },
  "audit": {
    "enabled": true,
    "lifecycle_events": true,
    "_note": "工具调用审计哈希链。append-only + SHA-256 链式防篡改, 落 data/logs/audit.ndjson。设 false 可关闭 (性能敏感场景)。校验: ppx 对话里调 audit_verify 工具, 或 npm run audit:verify。lifecycle_events (2026-11-05): 工单/指派/投递生命周期事件也入链 (白名单字段, 不含正文), 默认开。"
  },
  "embedding": {
    "base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1",
    "api_key": "lm-studio",
    "model": "text-embedding-nomic-embed-text-v1.5"
  },
  "experience": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "selfheal": {
    "enabled": true,
    "check_interval_ms": 60000
  },
  "tools": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "channels": {
    "http": {
      "enabled": true,
      "port": 8899,
      "auth_token": ""
    },
    "log": {
      "enabled": true,
      "target": "console"
    },
    "feishu": {
      "enabled": false,
      "appId": "",
      "appSecret": "",
      "verifyToken": ""
    },
    "wechat": {
      "enabled": false,
      "path": "/wechat/webhook",
      "token": "",
      "encodingAESKey": "",
      "corpId": "",
      "corpSecret": "",
      "agentId": ""
    },
    "telegram": {
      "enabled": false,
      "botToken": "",
      "api_base": "https://api.telegram.org",
      "poll_timeout_seconds": 50,
      "poll_interval_ms": 0,
      "allowed_chats": ""
    }
  },
  "voice": {
    "asr": {
      "backend": "local",
      "bin": "whisper",
      "flavor": "cli",
      "model": "small",
      "language": "zh",
      "timeout_ms": 120000
    }
  },
  "security": {
    "allow_all": false,
    "command_timeout_ms": 30000,
    "escalation_ttl_minutes": 0,
    "deny": [],
    "computer_control": false
  },
  "hooks": {
    "trust_project_roots": [],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "run_command",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node scripts/my-guard.js",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
